<title>UK: Hepworth first-half profit falls.</title>
<headline>Hepworth first-half profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.8		    vs 10.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.5		    vs same</p>
<p> Pretax		     35.5		   vs 37.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   396.1		  vs 377.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 29.5 to 35.0 million stg.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 35.5		   vs 37.5</p>
<p> Redundancy charges     2.4		    vs 1.1</p>
<p> UK pension charges     2.9		    vs 1.8</p>
<p> Property disposals     2.5 profit	   vs 0.1 profit</p>
<p> Interest charge	  2.5		    vs 1.1</p>
<p> Tax			  11.7		   vs 12.0</p>
<p> Pay date		   Dec 12</p>
<p> Div registration date  Oct 15</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Oct 7</p>
